# Lockfiles are generated. pnpm rewrites pnpm-lock.yaml on every install, so
# formatting it produces churn that the next install undoes. This line was
# missed by the npm -> pnpm migration (8fac64f), which left only the npm
# lockfile ignored — so gate 1 and the pre-commit hook failed on ANY dependency
# change until 2026-09-18. package-lock.json stays listed because npm is banned
# here and a stray one should not also produce format noise.
pnpm-lock.yaml
package-lock.json

